    <body>
      <div type="letter">
  <pb facs="650864" n="1"/>
<opener>
<salute rend="center">

<lb/>Celeberrimo Viro

<lb/>Dn. Johanni Bernoullio

<lb/>S. P. D.

<lb/>Joh. Jacob Scheuchzer: </salute>
</opener>
  <p>Accipe, Vir optime, <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_SCXN87T3">munusculum hocce</rs>, et pende, non ea qua gravitat[e] eruditionis et penetrationis lance, sed
          qua officiosi simul atque devoti erga Te pectoris affectum spirat. Abest ut vides et Tibi
          et Ill. <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118571249">Leibnitio</rs> Titulorum pompa;<note type="comment">Zur Widmung Scheuchzers an
            Bernoulli und Leibniz siehe den Brief von Johann Jakob Scheuchzer an Johann I Bernoulli
            von <rs key="B_991170514984705501" type="letter">1711.03.08</rs>.</note> non
          minuat hoc sed vel maxime augeat venerationem; sapit aliquantum divam Mathesin, quae nudam
          sese praesentat, ab affectatione sesquipedali aliena. Et pro modo sufficerent Tituli, nisi
          en omni eruditi orbis angulo undique conquisiti. Perrupit tandem obstacula, ut spero,
          <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_28S3J68W">Praelectio mea</rs>, lucem visum septimana proxima; et mox atque prodierit Manes Tuos salutatum. Vale Vir
          Celeberrime et me porro ama. </p>
  <p>Tiguri d. 14. Mart. 1711. </p>

<pb facs="650865" n="2" type="empty"/>
</div>
    </body>
